{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Custom Editor Build Integration.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Custom Editor Build Integration.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender custom editor build integration blender custom editor build integration","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Custom Editor Build Integration.md","fileName":"Blender Custom Editor Build Integration.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Custom Editor Build Integration","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:20\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender Editor Construction]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Editor Construction","Blender Custom Editor Registration","Blender Custom Editor RNA Integration","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Custom Editor Build Integration.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Custom Editor Build Integration.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender custom editor build integration blender custom editor build integration","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Custom Editor Build Integration.md","fileName":"Blender Custom Editor Build Integration.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Custom Editor Build Integration","heading":"Blender Custom Editor Build Integration","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A custom core editor requires coordinated source, header, and CMake changes. Its new directory and files must be added to editor build scripts, while public declarations, space-type registration, context accessors, and persistent DNA definitions must be updated where the new type crosses module boundaries.\n\nThe affected set is broader than the editor implementation because [[Blender Custom Editor Registration]] depends on window-manager startup and [[Blender Custom Editor